  "regions" : [ {
    "source" : "AS THE HERD\nCHARGES-\n",
    "translation" : "Enquanto a manada avança em disparada...",
    "kind" : "text_free",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.06458333333333334, 0.06680299931833675 ], [ 0.15416666666666667, 0.06612133605998637 ], [ 0.15416666666666667, 0.08588957055214724 ], [ 0.06458333333333334, 0.08657123381049761 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "IT'S\nTHAT DOG\nHE'S STARTED\nA STAMPEDE-\n",
    "translation" : "É aquele cachorro! Ele provocou uma debandada...",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.2139129638671875, 0.06313947015826038 ], [ 0.3329172134399414, 0.06313947015826038 ], [ 0.3329172134399414, 0.10734966878754473 ], [ 0.2139129638671875, 0.10734966878754473 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "JUNGLE COMICS\n",
    "translation" : "JUNGLE COMICS",
    "kind" : "text_free",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.40208333333333335, 0.032719836400818 ], [ 0.5760416666666667, 0.03067484662576687 ], [ 0.5760416666666667, 0.04294478527607362 ], [ 0.40208333333333335, 0.044989775051124746 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "I'VE GOT TO GET OUT THEY'LL KILL ME-BUT HOW? THEY'RE POURING THROUGH THE PASS AND THERE'S NO OTHER WAY OUT-",
    "translation" : "Preciso sair daqui, eles vão me matar — mas como? Eles estão passando aos montes pela passagem e não há outra saída —",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.3590366045633952, 0.06256181005726237 ], [ 0.57902037302653, 0.06256181005726237 ], [ 0.57902037302653, 0.12683564168543904 ], [ 0.3590366045633952, 0.12683564168543904 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "BUT AS THE INFURIATED\nELEPHANTS DESTROY ALL IN\nTHEIR PATH, CAMILLA AND HER\nFRIENDS ESCAPE INTO THE\nPOOL\n",
    "translation" : "Mas, enquanto os elefantes enfurecidos destroem tudo em seu caminho, Camilla e seus amigos escapam para o lago...",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.639726193745931, 0.06137822417068742 ], [ 0.916357676188151, 0.06137822417068742 ], [ 0.916357676188151, 0.11368866070810434 ], [ 0.639726193745931, 0.11368866070810434 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "LEAVING THE DESECRATORS\nTO CERTAIN DEATH-\n",
    "translation" : "Deixando os profanadores à morte certa —",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.06427925825119019, 0.35237746703519085 ], [ 0.31842918395996095, 0.35237746703519085 ], [ 0.31842918395996095, 0.3792645143016147 ], [ 0.06427925825119019, 0.3792645143016147 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "AS AT THE RIVER NEARBY-\n",
    "translation" : "Enquanto isso, no rio ali perto...",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.328125, 0.612815269256987 ], [ 0.5572916666666666, 0.6141785957736878 ], [ 0.5572916666666666, 0.6250852079072938 ], [ 0.328125, 0.623721881390593 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "I DIDN'T THINK WE'D MAKE\nIT THROUGH THE GROTTO-\nBUT WE DID AND THAT'S\nTHE END OF YOUR PARTNER\nAND HIS HENCHMEN\n",
    "translation" : "Eu não achava que conseguiríamos atravessar a gruta — mas conseguimos, e esse é o fim do seu parceiro e dos capangas dele.",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.32891661326090493, 0.6327145608331203 ], [ 0.5898052851359049, 0.6327145608331203 ], [ 0.5898052851359049, 0.6885809505075196 ], [ 0.32891661326090493, 0.6885809505075196 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "I DON'T KNOW HOW I CAN REPAY YOU.",
    "translation" : "Não sei como posso retribuir a você.",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.451461124420166, 0.6964558170373211 ], [ 0.5891473770141602, 0.6964558170373211 ], [ 0.5891473770141602, 0.7293632938980488 ], [ 0.451461124420166, 0.7293632938980488 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "REMEMBER ONE THING, TRADER.\nTHE LAW OF THE JUNGLE IS\nDEATH TO TRANSGRESSORS\nNEVER PLOT TO ROB THE\nJUNGLE OF ITS OWN.\n",
    "translation" : "Lembre-se de uma coisa, comerciante: a lei da selva é a morte para os transgressores. Nunca planeje roubar da selva o que lhe pertence.",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.6407279968261719, 0.611857554013825 ], [ 0.9118063608805339, 0.611857554013825 ], [ 0.9118063608805339, 0.6675000232990371 ], [ 0.6407279968261719, 0.6675000232990371 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "YOU'RE RIGHT\nCAMILLA NO\nMORE GRAVE\nROBBING FOR ME\n",
    "translation" : "Você tem razão, Camilla. Chega de saquear túmulos para mim.",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.7800400416056316, 0.6750529470619249 ], [ 0.9246449788411458, 0.6750529470619249 ], [ 0.9246449788411458, 0.7193411298568507 ], [ 0.7800400416056316, 0.7193411298568507 ] ]
  }, {
